                    "widget": {
                        "name": "text"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [],
            "properties": {
                "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
                "1. In the ComfyUI menu, open **Extensions**, then **KIE**, then **KIE Settings**, and save your key.\n2. Describe the product in **Product**.\n3. Press **Run**. The enlarged photo and the transparent cut-out go to `image/kie`."
            ],
            "title": "Start Here"
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "type": "MarkdownNote",
            "pos": [430, 60],
            "size": [400, 120],
            "flags": {},
            "order": 1,
            "mode": 0,
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "text",
                    "type": "STRING",
                    "link": null,
                    "widget": {
                        "name": "text"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [],
            "properties": {
                "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
                "Qwen Image draws the product photo. `guidance_scale` and `num_inference_steps` are set to `custom`: a higher guidance follows the prompt more closely, and more steps take longer and often look finer. `negative_prompt` keeps text and people out. `image_size` goes in `arguments`, under the name Qwen gives it.\n\nTo start from your own photo, add **Load Image** and connect it to the `files` input of **Upscale**. The node uploads it for the model."
            ],
            "title": "Note"
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "type": "MarkdownNote",
            "pos": [860, 60],
            "size": [400, 120],
            "flags": {},
            "order": 2,
            "mode": 0,
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "text",
                    "type": "STRING",
                    "link": null,
                    "widget": {
                        "name": "text"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [],
            "properties": {
                "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
            },
            "widgets_values": [
                "**File: Add** gives Recraft Crisp Upscale the photo as `image`, its only input. It enlarges the photo and keeps the edges sharp, with no settings to choose."
            ],
            "title": "Note"
        },
        {
            "id": 4,
            "type": "MarkdownNote",
            "pos": [1290, 60],
            "size": [400, 120],
            "flags": {},
            "order": 3,
            "mode": 0,
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "text",
                    "type": "STRING",
